They're the people who make this channel&nbsp;
possible, and who allow us to just really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:39.104
unleash our unrelenting investigation into&nbsp;
this tiny, tiny world that so much deserves it.

00:07:39.104 --> 00:07:42.540
We're really excited to continue&nbsp;
that investigation into 2023,

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:45.240
and the reason we can do&nbsp;
it, is our Patreon patrons.

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:51.000
So if you want to add your name onto this list,&nbsp;
you can go to Patreon.com/JournytoMicro.

